  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Quality Technical Assurance Group (QTAG) enables Australia to make informed decisions and exercise greater accountability for the performance and quality of agreed strategies and selected programs. QTAG provides strategic, advisory, review and quality assurance capability and services to support the delivery of Australia&#x2019;s development program in Papua New Guinea in the subnational, governance and law and justice sectors.</narrative>
